  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s 6 inch V-Max Lightweight Tactical Boot is designed to provide the comfort of a running shoe in a durable and rugged boot style. These boots feature a denier nylon upper and a nubuck leather body, offering a combination of lightweight breathability and sturdy construction. The rubber outsole ensures superior traction and durability, making these boots suitable for various terrains and conditions. Equipped with 7 iron eyelets and poly/cotton boot laces, these boots provide a secure fit.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132845",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s 6 inch V-Max Lightweight Tactical Boot is designed to provide the comfort of a running shoe in a durable and rugged boot style. These boots feature a denier nylon upper and a nubuck leather body, offering a combination of lightweight breathability and sturdy construction. The rubber outsole ensures superior traction and durability, making these boots suitable for various terrains and conditions. Equipped with 7 iron eyelets and poly/cotton boot laces, these boots provide a secure fit. The removable insole and comfortable padded collar enhance overall comfort, allowing you to wear them for extended periods without discomfort. Additionally, the boots feature two screen air vents for breathability, keeping your feet cool and dry. Whether you&rsquo;re on the job, hiking, or engaged in other demanding activities, Rothco&rsquo;s V-Max Lightweight Tactical Boots deliver exceptional comfort and performance. Available in AR 670-1 compliant coyote brown, these boots combine functionality and style, making them an ideal choice for those who need reliable footwear for tough tasks. Designed with precision and built to withstand the harshest conditions, Rothco's collection of footwear and accessories combines durability, functionality, and unparalleled performance. From our Forced Entry Series which features our speedlace and waterproof technologies, to our V-Max Collection designed with lightweight running shoe soles, our diverse range of footwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, Rothco is the go-to brand for all things that keep you standing on your feet.</p>",
